WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.076
The founder asks which service to offer.

00:00:03.076 --> 00:00:11.426
An AI model could make either option sound attractive, but the request lacks customer evidence, delivery capacity, and costs.

00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:15.381
Those are missing inputs, not facts we can invent.

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:22.413
Before recommending a service, name the purpose, the person served, and what the decision depends on.
